      "summary": "Patient Jonathan Miller called to book a cardiac follow-up with Dr. Elena Vance. AI identified patient by phone, verified availability, offered slots, and booked for today at 10:00 AM.",
      "outcome": "APPOINTMENT_BOOKED",
      "transcript": [
        {
          "text": "Thank you for calling Apex Cardiology. My name is Ava. How can I assist you today?",
          "speaker": "ai",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hi Ava, I need to book a cardiac follow-up with Dr. Elena Vance.",
          "speaker": "patient",
          "timestamp": "00:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "I would be happy to help with that. May I have your registered phone number or full name?",
          "speaker": "ai",
          "timestamp": "00:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "My name is Jonathan Miller, phone 555-019-2834.",
          "speaker": "patient",
          "timestamp": "00:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thank you, Mr. Miller. I see you in our records. Dr. Elena Vance has an opening today at 10:00 AM or tomorrow at 2:00 PM for a Comprehensive Cardiac Evaluation. Would 10:00 AM today suit you?",
          "speaker": "ai",
          "timestamp": "00:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yes, 10:00 AM today works great.",
          "speaker": "patient",
          "timestamp": "00:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "Splendid! I have confirmed your appointment with Dr. Elena Vance for today at 10:00 AM. We look forward to seeing you.",
          "speaker": "ai",
          "timestamp": "00:44"
        }
      ],
