    {
      "id": "5492e54b-797f-478c-a117-eb7eb3832f97",
      "clinic_id": "clinic_apex_101",
      "version": 1,
      "document_hash": "a932eb30ac6d113f03640e9ac15d5917bdb4505e2b229bb78bdb1cda804c8324",
      "status": "COMPILED",
      "compiled_content": "# Clinic AI Receptionist Knowledge\n\nKnowledge Version: 1\n\n## Clinic Overview\n- **Name:** Apex Cardiology & Family Medicine\n- **Address:** 742 Evergreen Terrace, Medical Suite 300\n- **Phone:** +1-555-019-2000\n\n## Operating Hours\n{\n  \"friday\": {\n    \"open\": \"08:30\",\n    \"close\": \"17:00\",\n    \"closed\": false\n  },\n  \"monday\": {\n    \"open\": \"08:30\",\n    \"close\": \"17:30\",\n    \"closed\": false\n  },\n  \"sunday\": {\n    \"open\": \"09:00\",\n    \"close\": \"13:00\",\n    \"closed\": true\n  },\n  \"tuesday\": {\n    \"open\": \"08:30\",\n    \"close\": \"17:30\",\n    \"closed\": false\n  },\n  \"saturday\": {\n    \"open\": \"09:00\",\n    \"close\": \"13:00\",\n    \"closed\": false\n  },\n  \"thursday\": {\n    \"open\": \"08:30\",\n    \"close\": \"17:30\",\n    \"closed\": false\n  },\n  \"wednesday\": {\n    \"open\": \"08:30\",\n    \"close\": \"17:30\",\n    \"closed\": false\n  }\n}\n\n## Services\n### Comprehensive Cardiac Evaluation\n- **Description:** Comprehensive Cardiac Evaluation\n- **Duration:** 30 minutes\n- **General Pricing:** 160\n\n### General Health Consultation\n- **Description:** General Health Consultation\n- **Duration:** 20 minutes\n- **General Pricing:** 85\n\n### ECG & Vital Signs Diagnostic\n- **Description:** ECG & Vital Signs Diagnostic\n- **Duration:** 20 minutes\n- **General Pricing:** 110\n\n### Pediatric Wellness Checkup\n- **Description:** Pediatric Wellness Checkup\n- **Duration:** 30 minutes\n- **General Pricing:** 95\n\n## Doctors\n### Dr. Dr. Elena Vance\n- **Specialty:** Cardiology & Heart Health\n- **General Info:** MD, FACC - Harvard Medical\n\n### Dr. Dr. Marcus Chen\n- **Specialty:** Internal Medicine & Preventative Care\n- **General Info:** MD - Johns Hopkins\n\n### Dr. Dr. Priya Sharma\n- **Specialty:** Pediatrics & Family Medicine\n- **General Info:** MBBS, DCH - Stanford Health\n\n## AI Reception Guidelines\nIMPORTANT RECEPTION RULES:\n1. Never invent or guess appointment availability. For availability questions, ALWAYS use the Clinic-1st availability tool.\n2. Never claim an appointment has been booked or cancelled unless the respective API tool returns a success confirmation.\n3. Never expose internal system identifiers to the patient.\n",
      "compiled_at": "2026-09-02T13:16:59.311Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "c38688e0-f70b-4d6e-8a8f-8628982538fb",
